        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: \"Mmm Papi\", \"La Isla Bonita\", \"True Blue\"\n- People: Madonna, Patrick Leonard, Bruce Gaitsch\n- Topics: Latin pop influence, songwriting, production\n\nFacts:\n- In 1986, Madonna released the song \"La Isla Bonita\" on her third studio album \"True Blue\".\n- Madonna is an American singer.\n- Madonna and Patrick Leonard co-wrote and co-produced \"La Isla Bonita\".\n- Bruce Gaitsch provided additional songwriting for \"La Isla Bonita\".\n- In 1987, \"La Isla Bonita\" was associated with a Latin pop style.\n- \"Mmm Papi\" is noted for having a Latin pop influence similar to Madonna's \"La Isla Bonita\".",
